\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Viability-preserving rollout ADP for orbital inspection. I. ISS mesh and required targets $\mathcal  K$ (orange rings). II. Camera-valid targets $G_j$ from range, FOV, incidence $\theta \leq \theta _{\max }$, and LOS checks. III. HCW transfer, motion audits, and directed SOOA construction; C70 and C68 are archived candidate IDs. IV. Depth-$d$ Bellman lookahead with complete greedy base-policy tails. At each leaf, $\DOTSB \sum@ \slimits@ \ell $ denotes the full tail cost; $+\infty $ denotes no certified completion within the remaining budget. V. First-action selection and planning-state updates toward the required goal $\Gamma _{\mathcal  K}(m)=1$. The tree is schematic; the 9/9 route is an archived offline plan. ISS geometry: \href  {https://science.nasa.gov/resource/international-space-station-3d-model/}{NASA}. Camera photograph: \href  {https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:SVCam-ECO_Series_black_with_Tubus.JPG}{A.~Lucke}, \href  {https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/}{CC BY-SA 3.0} (illustrative hardware).}}{2}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:sooa-framework}{{1}{2}{Viability-preserving rollout ADP for orbital inspection. I. ISS mesh and required targets $\mathcal K$ (orange rings). II. Camera-valid targets $G_j$ from range, FOV, incidence $\theta \leq \theta _{\max }$, and LOS checks. III. HCW transfer, motion audits, and directed SOOA construction; C70 and C68 are archived candidate IDs. IV. Depth-$d$ Bellman lookahead with complete greedy base-policy tails. At each leaf, $\sum \ell $ denotes the full tail cost; $+\infty $ denotes no certified completion within the remaining budget. V. First-action selection and planning-state updates toward the required goal $\Gamma _{\mathcal K}(m)=1$. The tree is schematic; the 9/9 route is an archived offline plan. ISS geometry: \href {https://science.nasa.gov/resource/international-space-station-3d-model/}{NASA}. Camera photograph: \href {https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:SVCam-ECO_Series_black_with_Tubus.JPG}{A.~Lucke}, \href {https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/}{CC BY-SA 3.0} (illustrative hardware)}{figure.3}{}}
