\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Supplemental ROS~2 execution with twelve 90~s transfers and 60~s settling intervals. All observations pass, accepting 9/9 required targets and 95.86\% weighted background coverage. Panels (a) and (b) highlight odd- and even-numbered views; hollow markers show the others. Both projections have equal spatial scale. Camera rows 1--6 and 7--12 show mission time, accepted required targets (Req), and weighted coverage (Bg). Uncropped frames and trajectories come from the same execution. Target credit uses fixed visibility masks and terminal tracking; the swept-body margin is audited against the full 3-D mesh.}}{12}{figure.94}\protected@file@percent }
